{"server":"tw","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_01_end","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_01","title":"清唱“晴空之歌”","storyCode":"ZT-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"550442aa3dac8a93f3815fc8306eb157b59562c914d71e6431791926c9930a34","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"在高塔上度過的黑夜總是安靜的，城市的夜晚卻很嘈雜。\n歡呼的聲浪一陣高過一陣，著裝優雅的樂手們捧著樂器一一離去。只有她坐在車的最後一排，不敢起身，更不敢看向窗外。\n“薇薇安娜，別怕。”有人走過來，拉起她的手。“卡西米爾和萊塔尼亞很不一樣，但你會習慣的。”\n她聽話地點頭，跟著人群下車。\n大騎士領的霓虹光彩刺過來的時候，她還是下意識閉上了眼睛。\n她沒有告訴任何人，在那一瞬間，自己害怕的並不是這個陌生國度。\n畢竟，她對萊塔尼亞的印象也僅僅來自房間裡一米不到的窗戶，很難說得上熟悉。\n她恐懼的，是外面這看似喧囂的夜，與記憶中那片小小的夜色也許並沒有太大差別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……洛文斯坦女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想起了剛到卡西米爾時的事情。那個時候……您也像此刻一樣，牽著我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手心都是汗。剛剛發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……沒什麼。我只是，與一位奇妙的女士聊了會天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在約瑟夫伯爵的辦公室裡耽擱了點時間，過來的時候，只感覺到你一個人站在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女士並沒有做什麼，對我也毫無敵意。她似乎也是來看畫的，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，那些畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我是不是該為您描述一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，請轉過頭來，不要再注視它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫的確有問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在巫王的時代，人們對源石研究的狂熱遠勝今日。追隨巫王的術師們，或是說藝術家們……不僅把源石視作施法材料或者能量的來源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們相信源石是另一種形式的血肉，將源石視作靈魂的載體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，畫上的黑色顏料……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"精煉過後的源石晶體，摻了畫家本人的鮮血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，這確實是一場精心設計好的“展出”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去把這些畫作蓋起來。用最嚴實的布料，盡量不要觸碰到畫幅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入侵者還沒找到，現在的美術館不太安全。兩位尊貴的女士，還是請快些離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有危險的不僅僅是我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這座城市裡生活的人們……都需要得到警示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"造成希曼夫人死亡，利用她畫出這些作品的，極有可能是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求您別說出那個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛文斯坦女士，女皇慶典近在眼前，您最清楚不過，陛下們絕對不想看見崔林特爾梅陷入混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我們在這裡的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……至少，請您通知今天來到美術館的那些人，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們看到了這些恐怖的畫，我很擔心他們的精神狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可真是溫柔啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經派人去逐一確認那些觀眾的情況了。您放心，我同樣希望他們什麼都沒看清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……子爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望希曼夫人不明不白地死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十三年前的那個夜晚，她就在那位陛下的高塔中作客，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她曾目睹過巫王的隕落，也見證了英雄的誕生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又……如何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，女士。那一夜，聚在那座漆黑的螺旋高塔面前，渴望著黎明降臨的年輕人……還有很多，很多很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他們中的大部分，都沒有如自己所期盼的那樣，成為給萊塔尼亞帶來新生的英雄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又有入侵者的消息了。女士們，我先告退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是對的。二十三年前的那一夜改變了很多東西，而變化……從來都未必是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殘黨們設計了弗里達·希曼的死亡，可能是為了懲罰她對巫王的“背叛”，也可能是想以此為訊號，宣告他們將有大動作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們也是出於同樣的原因，殺死了父親嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雕塑發出的奇怪聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請先別出聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想聽完這首曲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雕塑發出的奇怪聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是個流浪漢在演奏罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早晨，他也拉著同一首曲子，但心情截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他本以為來美術館的人會有很多，盤算著晚上可以點一個加獸肉腸的三明治。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在他意識到，自己可能又只能餓著肚子睡覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雕塑發出的奇怪聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您……用源石技藝查探了他的心聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有必要。您沒有發覺嗎？那位無家可歸的先生正在用他的音樂一遍又一遍地訴說，我所做的只是傾聽罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雕塑發出的奇怪聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……他的故事無關緊要。下一處舞台已經搭好了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"花壇邊，樂器形狀的石雕不再開口。\n取而代之的，是流暢低沉的樂聲，從雕刻內部的振動結構中發出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們萊塔尼亞人還真是喜歡這些會出聲的雕塑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一遍演奏都是一模一樣的“完美”，但又毫無靈魂……就和那些被困在高塔裡的人一樣。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾圖羅輕輕地，將一片花瓣吹向做成雕塑的大型樂器的氣口。\n花瓣順著氣流起起伏伏，整齊劃一的曲調立刻出現了細微的變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就好聽多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我們明明就快追到那個入侵者了，可他突然就沒了影子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的路依然封著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他總不能長著翅膀，從上面飛走吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翅膀……呵，還真不好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憲兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……隊長，我們真的很對不起您，在這個節骨眼上還總出問題，明明您馬上就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，皮姆。去找約瑟夫伯爵聊聊美術館的情況吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，我真是很久沒有聽到過銃響了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是在拉特蘭的時候，我也沒有用銃的資格，不過我向您保證，萊塔尼亞憲兵慣用的法杖，準頭和威力都不比銃差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在我手底下的人去而復返之前，您最好把銃……還有其他武器都收起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後您可以同我解釋一番——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼事務讓像您這樣的薩科塔來到崔林特爾梅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛里斯·博爾丁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？您竟然認得我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是前拉特蘭公民。二十八年前，你從拉特蘭來到萊塔尼亞，成為一名憲兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十三年前，雙子女皇授予你子爵的爵位。之後你便統領崔林特爾梅的憲兵隊，直至今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，我本來還指望您能先做個自我介紹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你協助我，將一名重要的通緝犯從萊塔尼亞帶回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通緝犯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的名字是阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我想起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是那個，拉特蘭教皇廳第五廳公證所執行者費……費……抱歉，您每次落款的前綴都太長，以至於我沒能記住您的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科·吉亞洛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之間的交涉屬於國際事務，按照慣例，落款理應盡可能嚴謹和完整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……哈哈，您給我寄的那十幾封信都還在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十七封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否並未仔細閱讀，甚至沒有拆開我寄出的信件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！怎麼可……總之您親自來到萊塔尼亞，以及這些年寫了這麼多信，都是為了追捕一名通緝犯，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她多年來一直在萊塔尼亞活動。我有理由相信，她與許多發生在萊塔尼亞的特殊案件，包括眼下你正在處理的多個案件有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先是那位已故的陛下，又來了一名拉特蘭通緝犯……還真是越來越麻煩了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否需要我從頭開始介紹嫌犯的情況？你也可以透過閱讀我寄給你的任意一封信件來獲取上述資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者閣下，打斷一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……盧卡斯男爵閣下，您請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些……擾亂秩序的街頭暴力團伙又出現了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我知道了。我馬上派人過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……當然，您說得對。我這就親自過去一趟。您放心，憲兵隊會保證您的安全，保證萊塔尼亞的榮光不受玷污。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……執行者閣下，我實在是忙得不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法認同。報案人的身份不應作為任務優先順序的評判標準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，這裡並非拉特蘭。順便，您也不能再隨意使用您的銃械，或者使用其他武器威嚇任何路過的居民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不僅如此。您在崔林特爾梅行動期間，最好不要離開我的視線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認為這符合流程規……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"規則？規則都是人定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會提出反對意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我會第一時間逮捕您，費德里科先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為在貴族的私人美術館附近多次鳴銃的人，您才是許多人眼中影響崔林特爾梅安定的最大因素。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博登區卡爾·施密特街。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫展上的死者弗里達·希曼長期居住在此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“金盞花小巷”，畫家與詩人都愛這個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧卡斯男爵在兩年前搬來這裡，想要“多親近下日益稀薄的藝術氣息”，當然，說不定只是因為這附近的房子遠比內城區的便宜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"緝捕對象極有可能也來過此處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別輕舉妄動。還記得我們的約定嗎？在萊塔尼亞，阿爾圖羅小姐是一名備受喜愛、聲名斐然的大音樂家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您目前正“協助”憲兵隊處理其他案件，在這個前提下，您發現什麼，與我和憲兵隊無關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發現疑似報案人口中的擾亂秩序的街頭暴力團夥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻執行……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建議立刻執行抓捕程序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一群不願意上課的年輕人罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧走吧，都別待在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然你也在這啊。街上的樂器石雕都是女皇下令建的，容不得破壞。而且叮叮噹噹的，都吵到人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不停下你的源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在雕什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒看見嗎？我只是在讓這條街變回它本該有的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"類似的旋角在崔林特爾梅……不，在萊塔尼亞絕對不容許出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開。在女皇之聲們發現之前，我們得毀掉它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毀掉它？你憑什麼認為自己有勇氣摧毀赫爾昏佐倫的標誌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏……你從哪裡聽來的這個名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人都知道。他馬上就要回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他統治的時期，你還不會說話。你都不知道這旋角意味著什麼。當年他每殺死一個異見者，就會在街上豎起一座這樣的雕塑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……已經有人死了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住在這條街上的那位畫家。她是第一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夾著尾巴逃跑吧，長官。你早就沒了當年的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倔強的學徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第一個踏進巫王塔的士兵”——你真當自己還是那個英雄嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小混蛋，你該不會以為，說這些就會讓我放過……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，跑就跑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不一見面就逮捕他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要讓監獄滿得太快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是否可以假定，你不願意逮捕他，是出於私人感情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我快後悔把您帶在身邊了，執行者閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意。自由行動更有利於我儘快鎖定目標人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我應該暫時把您鎖在辦公室裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還有一個在這裡？嘿，小子，再鬧的話我真的會把你們抓走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……旋角雕塑。您不是打算清理它們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，還有這些麻煩的東西。真搞不懂現在的年輕人在想些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在懷念一個未曾經歷過的時代。這稱不上什麼錯處，閣下。任何萊塔尼亞人都有權利對當下感到失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"例如……被維多利亞產的自行載具搶走工作的馭車術師們，受到藍卡塢影片衝擊而倒閉的社區劇院的老闆們，以及他們的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當人們找不到出路的時候，只得透過回溯過去想像未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，小朋友，你這話是跟你們家大人學的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我家的大人？我向您保證，她從不會把這些話說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的學徒","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只會，將一切萊塔尼亞的威脅扼殺在起點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雕塑……粉碎了？這麼輕鬆就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是普通的學生。你該叫住他多問幾個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，一點都不普通。所以我們最好什麼都別說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……下雨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想喝點什麼嗎？咖啡，還是啤酒？我推薦這家店的咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在執行任務的時候，沒有飲用會影響中樞神經系統的液體的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我要來點啤酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也正在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……執行任務。否則的話，我在這個時間一般還不會開喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個孩子說你是“第一個踏進巫王塔的士兵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說得沒錯。怎麼，想讓我在這張餐巾紙上簽個名嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望你能在我寄出的合作文件上簽名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者閣下，二十三年前您才幾歲？拉特蘭的報紙上，關於那場政變的報導，還不及新開的甜品店廣告版面大吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“成為崔林特爾梅憲兵隊長官的拉特蘭人”。報紙上是這麼寫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真的讀到過啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有關注過你和巫王的淵源。我瞭解到的洛里斯·博爾丁是一名屢破奇案、值得合作的執法者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你才寫了那麼多信給我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅的源石技藝很特殊，而你對處理類似的案件很有經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"1079年，你抓獲了一個擅長製造虛假愛情幻覺的盜竊團夥。1085年，你擊斃了一名危險的利用催眠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停一停。執行者閣下，您可別把我當成偵探戲裡的主角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛里斯·博爾丁，你似乎在逃避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什麼好逃避的？我只是儘早認清並接受了自己是個失敗者的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？揚……剛剛金盞花小巷裡那個不太合作的孩子，他有個姐姐，以前就在這家店裡工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五年前，她失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你對那位青年的特殊關照來看，這個案子至今未破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我經手的唯一一個破不了的案子。不是第一個，更不是最後一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它沒有任何特殊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是……在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……您是公證所的執行者，大概沒有過類似的失敗經歷吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博爾丁先生！您又來啦。最近過得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生叫我戒酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那可太慘了。讓一位萊塔尼亞壯年男士停止飲酒，不就跟讓他聾了一樣難受嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我本來還想著，等您退休那天，帶著憲兵隊的先生小姐們來我們店裡，我們會給您打五折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要退休了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等女皇慶典結束後，我就會離開萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂姆，揚那小子最近在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"揚？他申請的大學不收他，大概得學個正經手藝活了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的法術天賦不錯，中學成績也不差，為什麼沒有大學肯要他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他把您給他的推薦信扔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他說，與其操心他上什麼學校，您不如再花點力氣把尤利婭的下落找出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他還說……唉，既然說到這裡了，博爾丁先生，我覺得揚最近的確不太對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿到您為他寫的推薦信的那天，他問我，為什麼他爸爸上學的時候不需要這個。他爸爸以前可是憑著自己的能力就進了某位伯爵的高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“那位陛下還在的時候，天賦比家世重要得多。”他是這樣說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他最近都在什麼地方閒晃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旋角雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所說，揚以前不該知道旋角雕塑長什麼樣子。這意味著有人向他展示過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。以前哪裡的旋角雕塑最多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，古斯塔夫公園，離這不遠。如今改名叫密林公園了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂姆，今天早點回家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？好的。等等，博爾丁先生，您怎麼把錢包給我了？這麼多錢，都夠您再買一年啤酒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿著吧，這是給揚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛里斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1123_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子很聰明，應該上個好大學。這些錢應該夠他離開萊塔尼亞，去維多利亞或哥倫比亞發展了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨停了。\n即便是雨還在下的時候，公園裡的噴泉也沒有停。\n三三兩兩的人在樹蔭旁或坐或立，大部分都拿著樂器。小提琴，長笛，大提琴。人們幾乎沒有交流，但合奏的樂聲是和諧的。\n舒緩且哀傷的調子在水面上躍動，在樹木間飄盪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很小的時候聽說，在移動城市被建起來之前，恩瓦德曾經是一大片黑森林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每逢有重要的人離開，人們都會走進密林深處，一邊演奏離去之人生前最喜歡的曲子，一邊懷念他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有看到您拿著樂器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到萊塔尼亞的時候，我什麼都沒帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我以為自己會很多樂器。後來認識的一位可敬的老師卻說我根本不懂音樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不懂音樂……他其實是想說我不懂情感吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我想，我怎麼可能不懂呢？我並不算太長的生命裡分明充滿了失落與痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來……我的朋友死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定感受到了真正的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道自己懂了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我離開萊塔尼亞，去了很多地方。在每一個地方，我都會為那裡的人演奏。誇讚我音樂的人逐漸多了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我很久沒有再特地為那位朋友演奏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論您的演奏水準如何，您的朋友都會喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。就是因為我知道，我才希望自己能變得更好一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，我這一生算努力反抗過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能不能挺起胸膛告訴他，我已經度過了足夠充實的人生，充實到……能配得上那樣的犧牲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想像不出他會說什麼，因為……我還不確定該如何開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，先生？來到這裡，你是想緬懷誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位師長。他在二十三年前離去，但我沒有一刻忘記他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一定是個偉大的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說過，這個公園……就是為了紀念二十三年前的犧牲者而建立。每一棵樹的位置，曾經都是一座血肉鑄成的旋角雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我敬佩他們。他們擁有在那段黑暗的歲月裡站出來，去反抗命運的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許您也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們聽到的許多音樂，都比萊塔尼亞的歷史還要久遠。透過音樂，已逝之人的意志會在我們身上得以延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"延續……是啊。我也想相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到那邊站著的人了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……帶著劍，一直跟著您的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哀傷的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道他是誰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴厲，冷靜，缺乏情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們總是長著接近的面孔，像到我懶得花力氣去分辨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間到了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你確實浪費了不少時間，“烏提卡伯爵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好，我沒有認錯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"監管人先生，走進這個公園的時候，我其實以為我準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“陛下想要我的命的話，就拿去吧。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我的生命從過去到此刻，直至可預見的將來，都未曾真正造福過誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來這裡，是為了計劃自殺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍稍考慮了一下罷了。再說了，即便我的杖尖已經指在自己的喉嚨上，你也會衝上來阻止我的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵世之音還未奏響。你不能死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜……我並不樂意從任何人口中聽到這句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到這大提琴聲了嗎？這個下午，從樂聲中，自水面上，我又審視了一遍過去的經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結論是……相比幾年前，我的生命的確並沒有變得更有價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，依舊沒有人能利用和擺佈它。尤其是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埋伏？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"數個黑色法術球從積水中躥起。\n它們剛剛被偽裝成了樹木的倒影，伴隨著空中飄盪的旋律，在晃動的漣漪中積攢著能量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的青年","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是為了處決我，居然派出了這麼多人。想要讓我為女皇陛下們的賞識而深鞠一躬嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，我注定要讓她們失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確還沒想好何時能為他演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一件事，我確定自己會說給他聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我試過了。我一直在試。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我從未停止過反抗。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
